8f4e/v1

note
; @config testRuntime.enabled true

Across included source files, the later file replaces matching signatures.
Reversing the include order changes the winner and preserves other overloads.
noteEnd

entry test
group forward
includes
include test/signature-overrides increment selected
include test/signature-replacement
includesEnd

entry main
module assertions
call selected 3
assertEqual 30
call selected 1.5
assertEqual 2.5
moduleEnd
entryEnd
groupEnd

group reverse
includes
include test/signature-replacement
include test/signature-overrides increment selected
includesEnd

entry main
module assertions
call selected 3
assertEqual 4
call selected 1.5
assertEqual 2.5
moduleEnd
entryEnd
groupEnd
entryEnd
